[p]Pupultas![/p]
[p]A new update is here — this time it adds more content and QoL features to the game![/p][p]Have you tackled all the Diplomacy is Not an Option Challenges? Now [b]you have 6 more[/b] to figure out! Separated into 2 blocks, the new Challenges include a number of missions where your goal is to attack, and a few missions where you will have to survive under constant pressure.[/p][p]Additionally, [b]a new Endless Map[/b] makes its appearance! Enter the Gorge of Perdition and struggle in eternal fight against the Royal Army.[/p][p]We’ve also added [b]a bunch of attacking wave presets[/b] to Sandbox Mode — including those from the campaign. Now you can replay campaign scenarios by your own rules![/p][p]These are not all changes — the full list is, as always, under the cut.[/p][p]Also, today marks the start of the Steam Summer Sale! Till July 10th, you can get Diplomacy is Not an Option at 55% discount. Or you can check out a new [u][url="https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/55225/Survival_On_The_Frontier/?curator_clanid=4777282"]bundle[/url][/u] — this time we’ve cooperated with devs of Pioneers of Pagonia and Roman Triumph! Don’t miss the opportunity![/p][p]
