Pupultas!

The time has come to be reborn as the Undead. The update adding[b] a new story branch[/b] into the campaign is out! So, what is that about?  

The Undead update adds into the game:
[list]
[*] The Undead story branch with 5 new missions;
[*] Unique mechanics exclusive to the Undead;
[*] No walls — your army is your defense;
[*] Raise zombies — a special unit under your command can raise dead enemies as zombies. You also have access to Dark Resurrection spell;
[*] Zombies as a resource — use the acquired zombies as troops, create more powerful Undead out of them, or even recycle them into bones!
[*] The Undead buildings can be built on defiled soil only;
[*] New achievements;
[*] Twitch integration updated for the Undead.
[/list]And of course there are fixes and improvements to the game in general!

So, how to start playing the new story branch? If you have played DiNaO and already reached [spoiler]Ozzie[/spoiler], you can load a special [spoiler]save before his cutscene  — then you’ll be able to choose between supporting your current faction and the Undead.[/spoiler] If you just started playing the campaign, you can simply continue — in one of the missions you’ll be offered to change sides.

Additionally, we are launching the Autumn Sale earlier! Starting from 19:00 CET today [url=https://store.steampowered.com/developer/door407/?appid=1272320]all Door 407 games and additional content[/url] will be available for purchase with a discount! 

We also want to remind you about our recently announced [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3021530/AbraCookingDabra/]cosy cooking card game Abra-Cooking-Dabra[/url]. Don’t forget to wishlist it!

And don’t miss the two new bundles Diplomacy is Not an Option is now in! The first one is with [url=https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/46612/Thronefall_x_Diplomacy_is_Not_an_Option]Thronefall[/url], a cute minimalistic kingdom building strategy, and the second one is with a nice medieval city sim [url=https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/46626/Going_Medieval_X_Diplomacy_is_Not_an_Option]Going Medieval[/url]. Remember, bundles can provide an additional discount!

As always, we will be waiting for your feedback!

[i]Yours, the Door 407 dev team[/i]

P.S. The full list of changes, as usual, is under the cut.
